text:
Pasal 2
Tujuan perlindungan perempuan dan anak dari tindak kekerasan adalah : a. mencegah segala bentuk kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak; b. memberikan perlindungan dan pelayanan terhadap perempuan dan anak  korban kekerasan yang berbasis gender;
c. memberikan rasa aman terhadap perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan; d. memulihkan kondisi fisik, psikis dan ekonomi Perempuan dan anak korban  kekerasan;
e. kepentingan terbaik bagi perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan yang  terjadi di ranah domestik dan/ atau publik; dan
f. memberikan kepastian pendampingan pada pihak korban pada proses  hukum atas pelaku kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak.

translated_text:
Article 2
The objectives of protection of women and children from acts of violence are: a. to prevent all forms of violence against women and children; b. to provide protection and services to women and children victims of gender-based violence;
c. to provide a sense of security to women and children victims of violence; d. to restore the physical, psychological and economic condition of women and children victims of violence;
e. the best interests of women and children victims of violence that occurs in the domestic and/or public sphere; and
f. to provide certainty of assistance to victims in the legal process against perpetrators of violence against women and children.

